  (text "PICO 1 / RP2040 — FOUR-WIRE UART\nJ1/J2 pin 1: VSYS; pin 2: GND\nPin 3: left TX / right RX\nPin 4: left RX / right TX\nCable connects 1–1, 2–2, 3–3, 4–4.\nGP0 = TX; GP1 = RX (3.3 V logic).\nPower uses each Pico onboard USB diode.\nDo not connect the two 3V3 outputs.\nJ1/J2 are provisional 2.54 mm headers.\nConfirm purchased breakout dimensions."
    (at 335.28 109.22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1 1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "6af68662-00a7-4302-b341-b5093988ca21"))
